4) What actually reduces cycle time
Up-front automation



Dynamic checklist: instantly tailored + links to e-consent, bank-link (VOA), payroll-link (VOI/VOE).

Smart missing-items pings: if AUS/processor opens a condition, bot requests exactly that item with context and upload link.



Verification shortcuts



Bank & payroll APIs (Plaid/Finicity/Truework/Talon): bot initiates link flow.

OCR + field extraction for W-2/1099/paystubs/bank statements; auto-compare deltas against 1003 and flag anomalies.



Clarify blockers early



DTI/LTV calc in chat + alternative scenarios (more down payment, buy points, pay off small debt) to hit AUS pass quickly.



Self-serve status



Borrowers get current LOS status + which conditions remain, 24/7. Fewer emails/calls; processor time saved.



Guardrails



Policy RAG so answers cite your lender overlays, avoiding back-and-forth corrections.

Compliance logging with masked PII; transcripts ready for QC.

